      "summaries": {
        "en": "FinRobot is an open-source AI agent platform that automates financial analysis tasks using large language models, addressing the need for accessible, automated financial insights. It combines multimodal deep learning with specialized financial prompt engineering to process diverse data types like text, tables, and charts. Developers can build custom financial agents by extending its modular architecture, experimenting with different LLMs for tasks like market analysis or robo-advisory systems.",
        "zh": "FinRobot是一个基于大型语言模型的开源AI代理平台，专门用于自动化金融分析任务，解决了传统金融分析依赖人工、效率低下的问题。它通过多模态深度学习技术处理文本、表格和图表等多样化金融数据，并采用精心设计的提示工程来确保分析的专业性和准确性。开发者可以利用其模块化架构快速构建定制化的金融代理，例如用于市场趋势分析、投资建议生成或风险评估，为金融科技应用提供灵活的实验平台。",
        "es": "FinRobot is an open-source AI agent platform that automates financial analysis tasks using large language models, addressing the need for accessible, automated financial insights. It combines multimodal deep learning with specialized financial prompt engineering to process diverse data types like text, tables, and charts. Developers can build custom financial agents by extending its modular architecture, experimenting with different LLMs for tasks like market analysis or robo-advisory systems.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "FinRobot stands out for aiagent, chatgpt, and finance in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "FinRobot is an open-source AI agent platform that automates financial analysis tasks using large language models, addressing the need for accessible, automated financial insights. It combines multimodal deep learning with specialized financial prompt engineering to process diverse data types like text, tables, and charts. Developers can build custom financial agents by extending its modular architecture, experimenting with different LLMs for tasks like market analysis or robo-advisory systems.",
