      "summaries": {
        "en": "Chronos-Bolt-Base is a time series foundation model that simplifies forecasting by treating it as a language modeling task, eliminating the need for complex feature engineering. It leverages a T5 architecture to convert numerical time series data into token sequences, enabling zero-shot predictions across diverse domains. Researchers can fine-tune it on specific datasets for improved accuracy, while practitioners can use it directly for quick baseline forecasts in applications like energy demand prediction or financial trend analysis.",
        "zh": "Chronos-Bolt-Base是一个时间序列基础模型，它将预测任务转化为语言建模问题，通过T5架构将数值序列编码为标记流，实现跨领域的零样本预测。其核心创新在于统一处理不同时间尺度与模式的数据，无需手动特征工程即可生成可靠预测。开发者可基于特定数据集微调以提升精度，或直接应用于能源消耗、销售趋势等场景的快速基线分析，为时间序列研究提供了灵活高效的解决方案。",
        "es": "Chronos-Bolt-Base is a time series foundation model that simplifies forecasting by treating it as a language modeling task, eliminating the need for complex feature engineering. It leverages a T5 architecture to convert numerical time series data into token sequences, enabling zero-shot predictions across diverse domains. Researchers can fine-tune it on specific datasets for improved accuracy, while practitioners can use it directly for quick baseline forecasts in applications like energy demand prediction or financial trend analysis.",
